Package: cudatensr
Title: GPU-Aware Dense Tensors for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an experimental R-native dense tensor abstraction with
    explicit device management, matrix multiplication, reductions, and
    broadcasting. Uses an optional CUDA-enabled 'torch' installation for GPU
    execution and a transparent base R backend for portable development and
    continuous integration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudatensr
BugReports: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudatensr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    torch
